मनसैवेन्द्रियग्रामं विनियम्य समन्तत: ॥ २४ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1901,\"bb\":1681,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/24/b1681/\",\"body_value\":\"sa niścayena yoktavyo
