सुखेन ब्रह्मसंस्पर्शमत्यन्तं सुखमश्न‍ुते ॥ २८ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1930,\"bb\":1706,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/28/b1706/\",\"body_value\":\"yuñjann evaṁ sadātmānaṁ
yogī vigata-kalmaṣaḥ
